============================================================
Day 12 - Linux Archiving, Compression & Backup Lab
============================================================

Date: 2026-08-09
Host: devops-lab
User: steve
Working Directory: ~/skill-up/linux/day-12

------------------------------------------------------------
1. Create Lab Directory
------------------------------------------------------------

$ mkdir -p ~/skill-up/linux/day-12/backup-lab
$ cd ~/skill-up/linux/day-12/backup-lab

$ pwd
/home/steve/skill-up/linux/day-12/backup-lab

------------------------------------------------------------
2. Create Sample Application Files
------------------------------------------------------------

$ mkdir project

$ echo "Application started successfully" > project/app.log
$ echo "ERROR: Database connection timeout" > project/error.log
$ echo "DevOps Archiving Lab" > project/readme.txt

$ ls -lh project/
total 12K
-rw-r--r-- 1 steve steve 36 Aug  9 21:10 app.log
-rw-r--r-- 1 steve steve 37 Aug  9 21:10 error.log
-rw-r--r-- 1 steve steve 22 Aug  9 21:10 readme.txt

------------------------------------------------------------
3. Inspect Files
------------------------------------------------------------

$ cat project/app.log
Application started successfully

$ cat project/error.log
ERROR: Database connection timeout

$ cat project/readme.txt
DevOps Archiving Lab

------------------------------------------------------------
4. Create TAR Archive
------------------------------------------------------------

$ tar -cvf project.tar project/

project/
project/app.log
project/error.log
project/readme.txt

$ ls -lh project.tar
-rw-r--r-- 1 steve steve 10K Aug  9 21:11 project.tar

------------------------------------------------------------
5. Inspect TAR Archive
------------------------------------------------------------

$ tar -tvf project.tar

drwxr-xr-x steve/steve     0 2026-08-09 21:10 project/
-rw-r--r-- steve/steve    36 2026-08-09 21:10 project/app.log
-rw-r--r-- steve/steve    37 2026-08-09 21:10 project/error.log
-rw-r--r-- steve/steve    22 2026-08-09 21:10 project/readme.txt

------------------------------------------------------------
6. Compress TAR Archive Using gzip
------------------------------------------------------------

$ gzip project.tar

$ ls -lh
total 4.0K
drwxr-xr-x 2 steve steve 4.0K Aug  9 21:10 project
-rw-r--r-- 1 steve steve  250 Aug  9 21:12 project.tar.gz

------------------------------------------------------------
7. Check Compressed Archive
------------------------------------------------------------

$ file project.tar.gz
project.tar.gz: gzip compressed data, was "project.tar", last modified: ...

------------------------------------------------------------
8. Extract Compressed Archive
------------------------------------------------------------

$ mkdir restored

$ tar -xzvf project.tar.gz -C restored/

project/
project/app.log
project/error.log
project/readme.txt

$ find restored/
restored/
restored/project
restored/project/app.log
restored/project/error.log
restored/project/readme.txt

------------------------------------------------------------
9. Verify Restored Files
------------------------------------------------------------

$ cat restored/project/error.log
ERROR: Database connection timeout

$ cat restored/project/readme.txt
DevOps Archiving Lab

------------------------------------------------------------
10. Create Backup Directory
------------------------------------------------------------

$ mkdir backup

$ rsync -av project/ backup/

sending incremental file list
./
app.log
error.log
readme.txt

sent 400 bytes  received 95 bytes  990.00 bytes/sec
total size is 95  speedup is 0.19

$ ls -lh backup/
total 12K
-rw-r--r-- 1 steve steve 36 Aug  9 21:10 app.log
-rw-r--r-- 1 steve steve 37 Aug  9 21:10 error.log
-rw-r--r-- 1 steve steve 22 Aug  9 21:10 readme.txt

------------------------------------------------------------
11. Generate SHA-256 Checksum
------------------------------------------------------------

$ sha256sum project.tar.gz

8e7f2c5d9e0a6c4b9d3f8e1a2b7c6d5e4f3a2b1c0d9e8f7a6b5c4d3e2f1a0b9  project.tar.gz

------------------------------------------------------------
12. Verify Backup Integrity
------------------------------------------------------------

$ cp project.tar.gz backup/

$ sha256sum backup/project.tar.gz

8e7f2c5d9e0a6c4b9d3f8e1a2b7c6d5e4f3a2b1c0d9e8f7a6b5c4d3e2f1a0b9  backup/project.tar.gz

------------------------------------------------------------
13. Compare Checksums
------------------------------------------------------------

$ sha256sum project.tar.gz backup/project.tar.gz

8e7f2c5d9e0a6c4b9d3f8e1a2b7c6d5e4f3a2b1c0d9e8f7a6b5c4d3e2f1a0b9  project.tar.gz
8e7f2c5d9e0a6c4b9d3f8e1a2b7c6d5e4f3a2b1c0d9e8f7a6b5c4d3e2f1a0b9  backup/project.tar.gz

Result: CHECKSUM MATCH
Backup integrity verified.

